OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehog without prickles to be
OL,4,Acharity ambassador
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hedgehog who lost his prickles due to
OL,7,Fan infection has become an ambassador
OL,8,Ffor a Devon wildlife rescue charity.
OL,10,FOlly developed ringworm in the wild,
OL,11,Fwhich caused all of his spines to fall
OL,12,Fout.
OL,14,FJudy Thompson, co-founder of Prickles
OL,15,Fin a Pickle, where Olly has been for
OL,16,Fthe last four months, said: "Somebody
OL,17,Fsaid he looks like a rolled up sock,
OL,18,Fand he looks a bit like a very large
OL,19,Fpotato. He's about 1kg (2.2lb) in
OL,20,Fweight."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
