OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehog without prickles to be
OL,4,Acharity ambassador
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile recovering, he had become the
OL,7,F"poster hog" for the charity's latest
OL,8,Ffundraising campaign, bosses said. In
OL,9,F2025, it cared for 946 hedgehogs, with
OL,10,Fillness due to parasites accounting for
OL,11,Fabout half of all admissions, they
OL,12,Fadded.
